   "source": [
    "# 🔍 Sanskrit NLP Research Assistant — RAG Pipeline\n",
    "\n",
    "A production-inspired Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) system built over Sanskrit NLP research papers.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Stack:** LangChain · ChromaDB · Sentence-Transformers · HuggingFace · FastAPI\n",
    "\n",
    "**Pipeline:**\n",
    "```\n",
    "PDF Papers → Chunking → Embeddings → ChromaDB → Query → LLM → Answer\n",
    "                                                      ↓\n",
    "                                             Evaluation Metrics\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 📦 Step 1: Install Dependencies"
   ]
  },
  {
